---
description: Protect fluid Tailwind tokens and CSS file ownership
globs: src/styles/**/*.css
alwaysApply: false
---
# CSS & Tailwind Standards

- **`src/styles/starwind.css`**: Starwind theme tokens only (brand `--primary` overrides OK).
- **`src/styles/global.css`**: App entry — imports Starwind, fluid tokens, fonts, nav/FAQ project styles.
- Do not overwrite `--fluid-min-width` or `--fluid-max-width` unless specifically requested.
- Maintain existing `--fluid-bp` calculations for responsive scaling.
- Layout imports **only** `global.css`.
